{"title":"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b521c079f3bf8b8ae7a020f26ea4adce79d93c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2, \\ldots, 1989\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed as the disjoint union of subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f00d48bdab1e10ace01c3130ef87a78ef2d798e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_i, \\{i = 1,2, \\ldots, 117\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" /> such that\n</p><p>i.) each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2744600189f7f1df31756f2022b2d5212ef1c767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> contains 17 elements\n</p><p>ii.) the sum of all the elements in each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2744600189f7f1df31756f2022b2d5212ef1c767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> is the same.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us start pairing numbers in the following fashion, where each pair sums to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58f36e07c777841be994760a71f76fb3acac7e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1990$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/96056b469cb292659f0c87d1abc48dac970c7bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 1990-1), (2, 1990-2), \\ldots (936, 1054)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>There are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/3949c08f0f40b56c85d134161196abd1551a4141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117*8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" /> pairs above. Let us start putting these pairs into each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> subsets starting with the first pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/5/4e5e36626079981063019b80d09e2534a3f98726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 1990-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> going into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352dc820cffb31cfc6fa09846c2a37a7dc51ff09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 1990-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a8ae66ded7f33f9385a37c9cadfb82720013d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> and so on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e959dc4687eb6e895d48ac13fdcd40b7faf9c74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k, 1990-k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> going into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d250bc25c68c9c0a10edd6651e9fdf8f0878d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{k(mod 117)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers present in each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> subsets all of which have the same total sum. We need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more number to be filled in each subset from the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/00731f25fb2187c66b87b05c65285107657b5e20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(937, 938, ... 1053)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Let us arrange these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> numbers in the following manner:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c07037fbf3d575a3b37d5eb4b9abe964b575ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$995-58, 995-57,  \\ldots, 995-1, 995, 995+1, 995+2, \\ldots, 995+57, 995+58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"594\" height=\"16\" />  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0a4981f48eb21838a8f914b87c773a51eba939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$==&gt; (1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Now notice that for each number that's off by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f403449385d379f95d7301878fdf50310e3835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$995$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, there's a counter number off by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f403449385d379f95d7301878fdf50310e3835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$995$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> in the opposite direction.\n</p><p>So we need to create similar imbalances in the Subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d96a763a11c96a997841b1135cd77e63639770b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" />, so that we could add the above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> numbers to those imbalances to keep the total sum unchanged.\n</p><p>Now start swapping the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7ea9509746655dacd2e1e9b04c09510b683ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1st$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> number of each pair that we added to subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d96a763a11c96a997841b1135cd77e63639770b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" /> to create the above imbalances:\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afe61e5b80572ad5a200a0d9cd354ce12a8c7800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42beba41b8081c753f218104286f65a5fc88bae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{59}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> - this creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8dd9b9a09525dc9ddc912d904b22dbcda2839bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/384264d6ac9571f5ca95942b14afcb0be773784f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-58$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a8ae66ded7f33f9385a37c9cadfb82720013d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b784ad3135944214ca7ecade87b8dfa3aa54f1f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd68fde7521fcd9112c32c4012742ad2085eac42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> - this creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9f23f11d89ae7e1bba98c681014648d2c6ef3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa72a2522683722296453cdc0b89f5167b3c6bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-56$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0657f5cd42256c0a39d45b265235e2a939625515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/0103e71da350deee5d4215a851ca12a4f5fce2ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d8c9bd86e860fbfb7fbea5337e019790b1f952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> - creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe54585e0c171194b0e07cc59767d097999658cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Leave <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/616fde2229dfc90e1cf3a538189e9a8b215a483e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> as it is - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> imbalance.\n</p><p>Similarly,\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c26567322e56835900aeeea4486000e95087509.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d96a763a11c96a997841b1135cd77e63639770b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" /> - this creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73875c7ac7d989d087ae370d603f4d182d2d0f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+57$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a34623d13b6a7665111879cd0c405135d038f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-57$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866b44935f69a5b800547127fe13210bb1e36fbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$61$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07b5aea7be5b77902f6dea7978478123d05b27bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{61}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c62d5e0d0034ff8a4c269cc0741e852bf91db4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$116$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca521534e14b997ff46671cc3fa7bbd6bd95fc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> - this creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75ff751ee92b1e5991a78ca61a8bc6db71691055.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc5ea60a744025b2edc4374d9d7bb6d7bfab4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-55$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>Swap <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d924a5d0ade21a3824a7f0343f8beae70ef96e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$88$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/1/47197977a2ce37f8bbafd6646aacdbb61d92b507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e609f93104b193a2355181ca62ff083ea9fd3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cb671bde73d7c16e51783e2a969641d131ec044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{89}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> - this creates an imbalance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/1178af8fcc5f3f3acb9f151f7dcc2c4eefe88fd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Now start adding the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff99cacd74b61be0434acb70bce45baec948bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$117$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to the subsets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c7f3f828cf12ab9cafeffad282468a95219600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d96a763a11c96a997841b1135cd77e63639770b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{117}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"15\" /> to counter the imbalances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/384264d6ac9571f5ca95942b14afcb0be773784f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-58$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8dd9b9a09525dc9ddc912d904b22dbcda2839bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> so that the sum remains unchanged. Notice that each subset now has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> elements with total sum = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da39dad4fa88415399b728bb7a6145f4995b9490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8*1990 + 995 = 16915$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f8076e5958ba5b8ad3a15babff45d2bf28671a09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- Kris17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/e/6dedca6e8c7666507bc628e9a21890d142e052ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m = \\{117k+59+m\\}_{k \\in \\{0,...,16\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"257\" height=\"21\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> an integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/384264d6ac9571f5ca95942b14afcb0be773784f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-58$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b784ad3135944214ca7ecade87b8dfa3aa54f1f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78a391a7e99ea154be74b90440ab3fff313ec0ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B_n = \\{117n+k\\}_{k \\in \\{1,...,117\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"214\" height=\"21\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/85958f0a2e97436b04c39b30cecfda22fbaf0ebd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=0,...,16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f6b4b7cac5bfd8b372f185aab4b5c09548c24d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> be the summation of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. We will swap elements between the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552538bfb66b1718ced2741732e7e6347a12aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> until we have new subsets which satisfy the criteria. \n</p><p>Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd8731f6b53d792d1705a7bd6c37af32ff931e61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 1990\\cdot 17/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />. Note \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1b5060941378925ae6e13f42f322e1ac1443a10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S(A_0) = \\sum_{k=0}^{16} 117k + 59 = 117\\cdot\\frac{16\\cdot 17}{2} + 59\\cdot 17 \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (1)\\]\" width=\"416\" height=\"51\" />  \nwhich actually equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Clearly then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d25dc86b6b05c0c233e3a1f09a35948416c0e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S(A_m) = s + 17 m \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (2)\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\nfor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Now, fix <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> an integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b784ad3135944214ca7ecade87b8dfa3aa54f1f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and let \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae00aa8eebdfd13af6d639e214aa38ab5edaa911.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A_m&#39; = \\big(A_m \\backslash (B_0 \\cup \\cdots \\cup B_8)\\big) \\cup \\big(A_{-m} \\cap (B_0 \\cup \\cdots \\cup B_8 \\big)\\]\" width=\"421\" height=\"21\" />\nand \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72e5c1c2adf07d738bcde422d862062ca93d19c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A_{-m}&#39; = \\big(A_{-m} \\backslash (B_0 \\cup \\cdots \\cup B_8)\\big) \\cup \\big(A_m \\cap (B_0 \\cup \\cdots \\cup B_8 \\big).\\]\" width=\"438\" height=\"21\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f66a54c26099f302281d6e4ecd99ff6e085fc5af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{-m}&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" /> correspond to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552538bfb66b1718ced2741732e7e6347a12aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9278e4f86facef13dfd8b0cf7d2b121c7ee8d7c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{-m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> swapping the elements <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/51889369a72f48c61283476864eff2fb0b3511ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{59+m,59+m+117,...,59 + m + 8\\cdot 117 \\} \\subset A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"400\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/0306529de4710997be194b9e43e1e97e0e837cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{59-m,59 - m + 117,...,59 - m + 8\\cdot 117\\} \\subset A_{-m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"411\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Note these swaps change <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/956c17dd4140f8b124744fe2fbe7ee66ebaaea7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/5/0c5ca08ddd0ae59b685c3969885c57ff0ed7905c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9 \\cdot 2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />. That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/5897283dfa581f822f04170d48e578d077f26bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_m&#39;) = S(A_m) - 9 \\cdot 2m = s - m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"272\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />. Similarly,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4dc2338e45ce35035d1a7838e2b939d9290e5b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_{-m}&#39;) = S(A_{-m}) + 9 \\cdot 2m = s + m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"292\" height=\"22\" />. Since the swap occurred between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552538bfb66b1718ced2741732e7e6347a12aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9278e4f86facef13dfd8b0cf7d2b121c7ee8d7c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{-m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, we can use this to define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> for all other <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> values excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9730c7aa2adb4f49ddd60762ca8501705aca0418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_0&#39; = A_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc1aa71dc1d3852c1a1368907b6b420bb703ce92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{A_m&#39;\\}_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> is a partition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494d24121f75c086dd11be3b7e72760c9b1d1143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,...,1989\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" /> with each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> having <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> elements.\n</p><p>Introduce the following notation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b24d8ff85a87d66bfe7b09860bc24af76b1dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1,a_2,...,a_{116})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> is notation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04fe5bcd638d4cf8d1d9c2769676bb15e6409c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_j&#39;) - s = a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"119\" height=\"23\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8122aa89ea6e80784c6513d22787ad86e36ad0cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" /> is such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/7/b2793f6be8f7429e4de3b192413af66cd0ee5ecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59+ 9 \\cdot 117 +i \\in A_j&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"163\" height=\"23\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4af2db079e48f64b2a06e74ff177b5fae3f2123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_m&#39;) =  s-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, and (by definition of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552538bfb66b1718ced2741732e7e6347a12aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" />), we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f04fcfc0c3bc94ebffb763c8e1d4c7bfca6055d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59+ 9 \\cdot 117 + i \\in A_i&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/63858cbdf3b9f70b992936c6fbf0e8c3c8df7285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1,...,58$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc6496e129366996a8b81c20b83dd5a9dd2db37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59+ 9 \\cdot 117 + i \\in A_{i-117}&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"192\" height=\"22\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0243bbfb2656ecb889cc203a1bc39b114b59147d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=59,...,116$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d2208e239b6182e4d27122bf900674352894d3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-1,-2,...,-58,58,...,2,1). \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (3)\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"18\" />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b8247f68dac5cc482e979fc487b512dd7a95cb77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma_i(-1,-2,...,-58,58,2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" /> swap the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a05d572e6788d51f43954dbe53d49dece87c13ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/68965ca2836ef6e60f85d101194868a5995c5874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i+1^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"19\" /> component, then subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/6934c6c653b822d4b861f82307a28c4b4bb1df3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> component, and add one to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/68965ca2836ef6e60f85d101194868a5995c5874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i+1^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"19\" /> component. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a25b121b763a47463a67b2a361034723966630c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma_2(1,2,5) = (1,4,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />. Applying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897d8920e1f813a1385aaee235eb62ba3c51b6ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b24d8ff85a87d66bfe7b09860bc24af76b1dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_1,a_2,...,a_{116})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> corresponds to swapping two adjacent elements between two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" />, say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0bf168cf67d50bdd52f605b252c27a19cb9718c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_k&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7aacca32d7c73178129d84b4df3623029062d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_j&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"22\" height=\"23\" />, thereby increasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f5414ff07786aac59cb29e051b18531810ece9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_k&#39;)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and decreasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b743b7099eb090369ac2d11446c298c570e1f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_j&#39;)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"49\" height=\"23\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (or vice versa). Notice that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/4236071ffe764df10dc38b15cce69216e339810e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sigma_1 \\circ \\sigma_2 \\circ \\cdots \\circ \\sigma_{58} (-1,-2,...,-58,58,...,2,1) = (0,0,-1,-2,...,-57,57,...,2,1).\\]\" width=\"602\" height=\"18\" />\nClearly then, by repeating this process inductively, one can continue applying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897d8920e1f813a1385aaee235eb62ba3c51b6ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sigma_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> (doing swaps between the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" />) until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659505ac7531dd536023365bc7511dd1fe7433c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0,-1,-2,...,-57,57,...,2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> is mapped to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/689e60e347f1353cf1baf3b5db1af2614f60a7b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,...,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" />. At the end of these swaps we do not know which component corresponds to which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> (we do not know which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552538bfb66b1718ced2741732e7e6347a12aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/f/f9f7ea2de79436af8472920fc8ad34acb4c5bda7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59+9 \\cdot 117 + i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" /> is a member of). However, since all components equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd25606fe9efb5d5b455b2e465942994a3d4067d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_m&#39;) - s = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/678f96ced827c12d36ffa0a17e8d8e7ee62c4341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" /> regardless. On the other hand, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be778ea0eae2dc89c19b7334896bc1d49ac64c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S(A_0&#39;) = S(A_0) = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />. So \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18e9a8c92c60bfebe0abaadfe3bfb666f88bc51e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S(A_m&#39;) = s\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> \nfor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc1aa71dc1d3852c1a1368907b6b420bb703ce92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{A_m&#39;\\}_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> is a partition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494d24121f75c086dd11be3b7e72760c9b1d1143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,...,1989\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" /> with each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bf6d1310bb453fea8346c4a947e2285d12972b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_m&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> having <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> elements.\n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO\" title=\"1989 IMO\">1989 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>